WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.484 --> 00:00:03.522
eganyé. Your tontine, on your phone.

2
00:00:03.871 --> 00:00:07.692
Lost notebooks. Who paid? Who’s missing?

3
00:00:07.742 --> 00:00:11.116
Your circles, your money. All in one place.

4
00:00:11.613 --> 00:00:15.899
Start your circle. Invite your people, by link or by code.

5
00:00:17.419 --> 00:00:23.001
Pay in with Flooz or Mixx. Every franc is visible, and the pot fills up.

6
00:00:23.226 --> 00:00:28.982
At eganyé’s heart: AI. It estimates your reliability, and explains your score.

7
00:00:29.032 --> 00:00:31.110
It warns you before you’re late.

8
00:00:31.935 --> 00:00:35.756
It estimates each round’s risk, without naming anyone.

9
00:00:35.806 --> 00:00:38.076
And it never decides for you.

10
00:00:38.226 --> 00:00:41.384
When it’s your turn, the pot lands in your wallet.

11
00:00:41.613 --> 00:00:45.144
Put money aside in your vaults. Withdraw with your PIN.

12
00:00:45.194 --> 00:00:47.872
eganyé. Let’s save together.
